==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[fá]]'' meaning "to [[have]]" and ''[[sér]]'', the {{dative}} form of ''[[sig#Icelandic|sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]" + ''[[göngutúr]]'' meaning a "[[walk]]".

===Verb===
'''[[fá#Icelandic|fá]] [[sig#Icelandic|sér]] [[göngutúr]]'''

# to [[go]] for a [[walk]]; to [[stroll]]

[[Category:Icelandic verbs]]

[[is:fá sér göngutúr]]